meta {
  name: Get Session
  type: http
  seq: 13
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/session
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  Lightweight session check used by the SPA to hydrate its auth state from the httpOnly cookies.
  The session cookie is sent automatically by the Cookie Jar.
  Returns 200 (not 401) with:
    { "authenticated": true,  "user": { "id": "...", "email": "..." } }
    { "authenticated": false, "user": null }
  The backend performs a silent refresh here: if the access token is expired but the refresh
  token is still valid, it mints a new session and re-issues both cookies transparently.
}